WEBVTT

00:11:27.125 --> 00:11:30.708
of the importance of inclusion
and representation.

00:11:32.958 --> 00:11:35.018
Let me tell you this, too.

00:11:35.042 --> 00:11:37.851
In the 2013 general elections in Pakistan

00:11:37.875 --> 00:11:41.500
and the local elections in 2015,

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:45.250
there were less than 100
women voters in Dir.

00:11:46.833 --> 00:11:48.101
But you know what?

00:11:48.125 --> 00:11:52.768
I'm proud to tell you that this year,
during the general elections,

00:11:52.792 --> 00:11:56.101
there were 93,000 women voters in Dir.

00:11:56.125 --> 00:12:02.167
(Applause)